      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "mental"
      ],
      "text": "20 feet. A creature that starts its turn in the aura must succeed at a DC 23 Will save save or become Confused for 1 round; on a success, that creature is temporarily immune for 1 minute.\n\nJafaki can suppress or activate this aura as a single action with the concentrate trait.",
      "rules": [
